{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S02、S05\",\n      \"why\": \"S02明确写出越想维持分寸、心里的分量反而越压不住，但将焦急的直接原因归于对方是否知道自己的心意没有答案；S05写出外在支撑撤掉后被压住的温柔显露，却没有完整解释为什么越用力撑住自己本身就会越清楚地意识到眷恋。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S02、S05、S06\",\n      \"why\": \"S02把强烈投入没有改变距离、没有得到确认与同样的在意再次出现连起来，S05进一步写明越舍不得就越在意对方是否知道，S06则写出追问直到疲惫耗尽的过程，形成了无答案、不舍与再次追问之间的因果链。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"没有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S01、S04、S09\",\n      \"why\": \"S01的突然是初次受到牵挂冲击，S04的熟悉感带来的是短暂安定，S09则是现实距离突然重新刺痛人；稿子没有写出熟悉感突然闯入、身体先受惊、继而通过受惊照见缺席这一完整因果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S06、S11–S13\",\n      \"why\": \"S06明确写出焦急耗尽、无力继续追问后，人转而单纯感受对方的意义；S11又把长久的等待、亲近与距离感积累成站起来承受的力量，S12–S13进一步说明即使未知仍在，对对方的在乎也不再使人退缩。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [],\n  \"loops\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c031a29-b10b-4f32-b6ac-1053a6ace592", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130325915409Z", "elapsed_seconds": 481.61, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:11:27.536148+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fc91dd2826eb30018cbb42f629b1e5b9ac86e44f84517f8f49b75cd0757e603b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pu